{"id": "EUVD-2026-104396", "enisaUuid": "4b3c2942-ad95-38d9-896a-dabca47c6ce9", "description": "docTR through 1.1.0 contains an unsafe deserialization vulnerability in load_pretrained_params() that loads checkpoints with torch.load without weights_only=True. Attackers who control a local or URL-supplied checkpoint can embed a malicious pickle payload to execute Python code with the loading process's privileges on torch releases before 2.6.", "datePublished": "2026-10-19T15:28:54", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-22T02:59:45", "baseScore": 7.7, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:P/PR:N/UI:P/VC:H/VI:H/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/mindee/doctr/issues/2175", "https://github.com/mindee/doctr/commit/687503dd15592483c4699ee51280b41938579a9e", "https://github.com/mindee/doctr/blob/v1.1.0/doctr/models/utils/pytorch.py", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/doctr-through-1.1.0-unsafe-deserialization-rce-via-load-pretrained-params"], "aliases": ["GHSA-rh68-f334-2256", "CVE-2026-112304"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.29, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "dfb20c6e-5aa2-3c23-89d9-2a58799a4b6b", "product": {"name": "docTR", "vendor": {"name": "Mindee"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22641.1.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "967bacff-b36d-3327-8457-3370cd8415a5", "vendor": {"name": "Mindee"}}], "isExploited": false}